# Next.js Example — USDC Payments SDK Demo

This is a complete working example of how to integrate the USDC Payments SDK for Stellar into a Next.js application.

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites
- Node.js 18+ 
- npm or yarn
- Freighter wallet extension (for browser testing)

### Installation & Setup

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start development server
npm run dev
```

Visit [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) to see the demo.

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
examples/
├── pages/
│   └── index.tsx           # Main demo page
├── package.json           # Dependencies and scripts
├── next.config.cjs        # Next.js configuration
├── tsconfig.json          # TypeScript configuration
